# EducPAY Phase 3B - Supabase configuration
# The frontend uses Vite. These two values are public Supabase client values (do NOT commit secrets).
# Examples (replace with your project's values):
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://xxxxx.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=xxxxx
# One-time Super Admin initialization (server-side only; never expose in Vercel frontend variables).
# SUPABASE_URL=https://xxxxx.supabase.co
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=xxxxx
# SUPER_ADMIN_EMAIL=admin@example.com
# SUPER_ADMIN_TEMP_PASSWORD=use-a-long-random-password
# Public absolute URL used by Supabase Auth invitation redirects.
# PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://your-educpay-domain.example
# Custom application emails are recorded in public.email_events. Configure
# delivery outside the frontend (Supabase Auth handles activation emails).
# EducPAY Phase 1 is a public landing page and requires no additional environment variables.
